cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "CONFIRM: baseline-table extraction and arithmetic verification for randomized controlled trials"
abstract: >-
  A three-stage pipeline that harvests randomized controlled trials with full
  text in PubMed Central, extracts baseline-characteristics tables into a flat
  dataset, and applies the GRIM reachability test to reported means. Rows whose
  measure type, sample size, or table structure cannot be established are
  excluded and logged rather than guessed at.
type: software
